msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"I heard the Gelateria Kamuro on Taihei Boulevard's pretty popular among "
"office workers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Do you eat a lot of gelato, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Yeah, I go pretty often."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"A lot of men I know seem to like cakes and other sweets. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "I like them, too. Men who like sweets, that is..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Hehehe... Well, aren't you adorable? <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"I heard the famous actor Noboru Kudarizaka sometimes goes incognito to visit"
" Sushi Gin on Showa Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"Wha⑬!? Did you say Noboru Kudarizaka? I'm a huge fan of his! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "You are?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Yes, actually... I love action movies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"I watch them all the time, especially yakuza films. I just long for that "
"hypermasculine world..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "Do you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"Hehehe... Maybe I'll check out Sushi Gin next time. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"I heard that the kimchi over at the yakiniku restaurant Kanrai is made with "
"real peppers from Korea. Apparently it's good for you, due to the... "
"something-cin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Um... The... capsaicin, I think it was?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Yeah, that's it. Capsaicin is supposed to be good for your health."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "I don't like spicy food, though. I always get the sweet curries."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"I used to eat spicy food all the time, but ever since I matched my tastes to"
" my son's, I haven't really been able to deal with anything spicy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "That's too bad."
msgstr "Che peccato."

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"I heard the ramen at Kyushu No. 1 Star over on Pink Street is full of "
"collagen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Kyushu No. 1 Star... that ramen shop, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"The previous owner returned, and now they're making authentic Kyushu-style "
"tonkotsu ramen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid ""
"According to the owner, they boil the pork bones until they break down in "
"the broth, making it super rich in collagen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Well, hearing you talk about it makes me want to go out and try some. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I'll stop by there next time I'm free."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "You know the Yoshida Batting Center?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Yeah, the one over on Shichifuku Street, right? What about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "Turns out pro baseball players visit it sometimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "Whoa! Really?"
msgstr "Wow, davvero?"

msgctxt "736"
msgid "Yeah. Do you like baseball?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "Hehehe... Despite appearances, I happen to be a pretty big sports fan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid ""
"Have you heard about the Matcha Fair that Café Alps is having over on "
"Nakamichi Street?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "Oh, really? I just love Japanese sweets! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr "Ah sì?"

msgctxt "796"
msgid "Hehehe.... Maybe I'll go next time I'm free."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "Have you tried the braised pork burger over at Smile Burger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "Oh! Did you read about that on a certain idol's blog?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "Oh, you already knew about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "Hehehe... I happen to be a blogger myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid ""
"Though all I ever post about is work and my son. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid ""
"I heard you can make reservations for handbags at Le Marche over on Showa "
"Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid "Huh!? Really?"
msgstr "Eh!? Davvero?"

msgctxt "892"
msgid ""
"Apparently, they go over to Europe every two months to pick up some new "
"inventory, so if you put in an order with the owner ahead of time, he can "
"buy you one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid "Really!? There just so happens to be this bag I really want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "It's sold out everywhere, so I'd given up on finding it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid ""
"Next time I go to Le Marche, I'll ask the owner! <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid ""
"Do you know what Tantakatan is? It's a kind of shochu made from red "
"perilla..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "Oh, Tantakatan? Yeah, of course I know it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid "I like to mix it with cranberry juice for certain cocktails."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid ""
"It's delicious and has a great mouthfeel, so I always end up drinking it too"
" quickly. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default> Hehehe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid ""
"There's a shop in Okinawa's Kariyushi Arcade with really good rafute..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "Rafute? That's braised pork belly, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid ""
"I think I've seen it on TV before. Okinawan rafute loses its excess fat "
"while it cooks, so it's actually quite nutritious and healthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid "Oh, I'm surprised you knew about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid "Hehehe... I'm just full of trivia, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid ""
"Have you heard of the legendary snack at the bar Aqua Sky in Hatsumachi, "
"Okinawa?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid "Huh...? No, I can't say I have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072"
msgid "Well, there's this legendary snack there... Care to guess what it is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid ""
"A legendary snack? Well, since it's Okinawa... Would it be something like "
"tofuyo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid "It's salt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "Salt? As in salt and pepper?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it's a special kind of salt that's only made in Okinawa. It has a hint"
" of sweetness to it, too, which supposedly brings out the flavor in "
"alcoholic drinks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1132"
msgid "Huh... Salt. That's so... tastefully adult."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid "You should try it sometime."
msgstr "Dovresti provarla qualche volta."

msgctxt "1156"
msgid "So, about Gelateria Kamuro..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1168"
msgid "Hehehe... You must really like gelato, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180"
msgid ""
"I go to that gelateria a lot, too. My son loves strawberry gelato, so I buy "
"it for him every now and then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1192"
msgid "Oh, you do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid "Yes. We split a serving, though. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid "Have you tried out Sushi Gin yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1228"
msgid "Yeah. And guess what? I actually ran into Noboru Kudarizaka..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1240"
msgid "You did? What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1252"
msgid ""
"I asked him for his autograph, but then we ended up talking business. "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1264"
msgid "He promised me that he'd visit our club later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1276"
msgid "Wow... I'm impressed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1288"
msgid "About that kimchi at Kanrai..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
msgid ""
"After you told me about it, I asked one of the other girls to buy me some so"
" I could try it for myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid "How was it?"
msgstr "Com'è stato?"

msgctxt "1324"
msgid "Super spicy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1336"
msgid "Well, yeah."
msgstr "Beh, sì."

msgctxt "1348"
msgid ""
"But I ended up eating it all. It's easy to get hooked on kimchi like that! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1360"
msgid "Maybe I'll let my son try some."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1372"
msgid "Have you gone to Kyushu No. 1 Star yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1384"
msgid ""
"Yes, I did. But the smell of pork bones was a little too strong for me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1396"
msgid "The odor turned me away before I even went inside..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1408"
msgid "I actually like how it smells."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1420"
msgid "Sorry... I know you went out of your way to tell me about it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1432"
msgid "Have you been to the Yoshida Batting Center yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1444"
msgid "Hehehe... I took a peek inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1456"
msgid "Unfortunately, there weren't any pro players there when I went."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1468"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1480"
msgid ""
"Maybe I'll bring my son to play there on my next day off. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1492"
msgid "Have you been to the Matcha Fair at Café Alps?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1504"
msgid ""
"Yes, I had a matcha parfait. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> It was delectable..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1516"
msgid "I'm glad to hear that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1528"
msgid ""
"Now I feel like I need to sample the entire menu. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1540"
msgid "Heh... Thanks for the tip, Kiryu-san! <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1552"
msgid "Have you tried that braised pork burger yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1564"
msgid "Oh, I did. It was pretty tasty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1576"
msgid ""
"I think braised pork pairs pretty well with bread. My son kept saying how "
"yummy it was. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1588"
msgid "I'm glad you both liked it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1600"
msgid "Did you get to reserve anything at Le Marche?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1612"
msgid ""
"I did. They're going to Europe next month, so they'll find the bag I want "
"when they do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1624"
msgid "Glad to hear it."
msgstr "Mi fa piacere."

msgctxt "1636"
msgid ""
"I have you to thank for that, Kiryu-san. I'll be sure to repay you next "
"time. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1648"
msgid "So, about that Tantakatan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1660"
msgid "You mentioned it before. Do you like Tantakatan, too, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1672"
msgid "You could say that, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1684"
msgid "Hehehe... I'm glad we share similar tastes. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1696"
msgid ""
"Let's take it slow and enjoy a bottle together next time\r\n"
"I see you. <Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1708"
msgid "About that Okinawan rafute..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1720"
msgid ""
"I had a craving for it after you told me about it, Kiryu-san, so, I went to "
"an Okinawan restaurant near my house."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1732"
msgid ""
"That rafute was seriously delicious. But now I want to go try it in Okinawa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1744"
msgid "You know that legendary snack I mentioned?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1756"
msgid "You told me before. Okinawan salt, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1768"
msgid ""
"I can't get any over here. Be sure to bring me back some if you ever go to "
"Okinawa, okay?"
msgstr ""

